Kata

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,700
Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wasallam,

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,900
barang

4
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:13,890
siapa

5
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,380
yang

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,880
ada tanah,

7
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:25,400
