10
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,350
Sebab apa kena suruh tanam?

11
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:35,700
Kalau tak tanam, tanah jadi hutan.

12
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,700
