13
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,790
Mengganggu jiran.

14
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:43,010
Rumah saya di Bangi.

15
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:46,930
Saya buat rumah lama, tahun 2004.

16
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:50,700
Jiran saya sebelah beli tanah.

17
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:53,980
Sampai sekarang tak buat rumah.

18
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,670
Kanan dan kiri.

19
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:57,720
Kanan kiri hutan.

20
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:00,700
Tebang, banyak kali tebang dah.

21
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:03,370
