30
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:33,700
Bila tanam dia tersusun.

31
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:36,600
Bila tersusun, dia diuruskan.

32
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,700
Maka Islam mengajar jangan abaikan

33
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,800
